    "text": "Given to players at the Sun & Moon prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 21–22 and 28–29 January 2017. Each kit held four Sun & Moon booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Sun & Moon logo. The packs also held a non-holo Crobat, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
